    16	
    17	In scope:
    18	
    19	- prep clarification gate and suspend/resume;
    20	- plan artifact boundaries;
    21	- critique skip, selection, retry, fanout, merge, and adaptive critique policy;
    22	- gate preflight, normalization, reprompt/downgrade, and debt effect;
    23	- bounded critique/gate/revise loop with typed outcomes;
    24	- severity-as-data plus severity-threshold routing as source/policy visible
    25	  topology;
    26	- quarantine or deletion of replaced front-half component/handler carriers.
    27	
    28	Out of scope:
    29	
    30	- tiebreaker internals, except the typed interface and call/rejoin shape needed
    31	  by the front-half loop;
    32	- execute, review, and override extraction beyond compatibility required to keep
    33	  the loop running.
    34	
