    36	
    37	- Replace front-half component calls as proof carriers with source-visible
    38	  branch, loop, fanout, gate, and policy constructs.
    39	- Ensure critique lens selection may remain phase-local only if resulting
    40	  fanout cardinality is visible to the workflow.
    41	- Keep gate signal building and payload normalization in handlers only when the
    42	  handlers emit typed outcomes and cannot route.
    43	- Delete or quarantine component route/topology metadata as each row moves.
    44	- Extend dead-delete mutation coverage for every replaced front-half carrier.
    45	
    46	## Verifiable Completion Criterion
    47	
    48	- A reviewer can follow prep through revise in `.pypeline` and named
    49	  subworkflows without consulting `components.py`.
    50	- Split-outcome scenarios pass:
    51	  - prep blocking questions suspend and resume;
    52	  - unresolved blocking flags reprompt/downgrade;
    53	  - critical cap exhaustion blocks;
    54	  - cosmetic-only cap exhaustion force-proceeds.
    55	- Semantic checker emits row-level evidence for every implemented front-half
