refer Pipeline.native_program."}],"signals_assessment":"Weighted score 6.0 on iteration 1, with 3 open significant flags all in the correctness category. Preflight checks passed (directory exists, writable, Criteria present). The critique worker partially degraded on scope/prerequisite_ordering checks, but those are meta-concerns about plan structure rather than blocking flaws. No recurring critiques or addressed-then-reopened flags. The plan delta is null (first iteration). Flag concerns are specific and tractable rather than systemic.","warnings":["critique degraded: high-complexity check(s) unverifiable (scope, prerequisite_ordering); operator attention required before treating critique as complete.","Evidence pack parity tests (Phase 4) must include JSON key-sorting or other ordering normalization to guarantee deterministic output comparison between native and legacy paths.","The manifest entrypoint enforcement described in Step 4 is already partially implemented; the implementation worker should verify manifest.py validation is sufficient rather than re-implementing it.","Phase 5 golden trace regeneration may surface subtle behavioral differences between native and graph execution; budget time for investigation if snapshot diffs appear beyond ordering."]},"meta":{"critique_unverifiable_checks":[{"checks":[{"attention":"high_complexity_unverifiable","complexity":4,"id":"scope","question":"Search for related code that handles the same concept. Is the reported issue a symptom of something broader — and is any single step sized to fit one worker turn?","reason":"parallel critique worker failed for check 'scope': Hermes worker failed for step 'critique': worker_structural_audit_failed: model output structural audit failed: additional_property at /name: unexpected property 'name'; additional_property at /path: unexpected property 'path'; additional_property at /tool_call_id: unexpected property 'tool_call_id'"},{"attention":"high_complexity_unverifiable","complexity"