:485:    # choice, or the override CLI rejects the missing --note as invalid_args.\ntests/test_auto.py:1572:    CLI rejects it as invalid_args and the auto-driver loops until stalled.\ntests/test_mode_deprecation.py:252:    CliError('invalid_args'). The hard contract lives at init.py and is\ntests/test_mode_deprecation.py:260:    assert excinfo.value.code == \"invalid_args\"\ntests/test_mode_deprecation.py:268:    CliError('invalid_args'). metaplan coerces to mode='doc' BEFORE the\ntests/test_mode_deprecation.py:276:    assert excinfo.value.code == \"invalid_args\"\ntests/test_mode_deprecation.py:284:    CliError('invalid_args'). The creative pipeline cannot dispatch\ntests/test_mode_deprecation.py:292:    assert excinfo.value.code == \"invalid_args\"\nmegaplan/handlers/init.py:100:      — empty after strip raises ``CliError('invalid_args')``.\nmegaplan/handlers/init.py:177:            raise CliError(\"invalid_args\", \"--prep-direction must be non-empty when provided\")\nmegaplan/handlers/init.py:203:        raise CliError(\"invalid_args\", \"Pass either the positional idea or --idea-file, not both\")\nmegaplan/handlers/init.py:209:            raise CliError(\"invalid_args\", f\"Unable to read --idea-file {idea_path}: {exc}\") from exc\nmegaplan/handlers/init.py:211:            raise CliError(\"invalid_args\", \"--idea-file must contain non-empty UTF-8 text\")\nmegaplan/handlers/init.py:215:        raise CliError(\"invalid_args\", \"Provide an idea argument or --idea-file <path>\")\nmegaplan/handlers/init.py:232:        raise CliError(\"invalid_args\", \"--primary-criterion is only valid with --mode joke or --mode creative\")\nmegaplan/handlers/init.py:234:        raise CliError(\"invalid_args\", \"--form is only valid with --mode creative\")\nmegaplan/handlers/init.py:237:            raise CliError(\"invalid_args\", \"--form is required when --mode creative is selected\")\nmegaplan/handlers/init.py:239:            raise CliError(\"invalid_args\", f\"Unknown creati