codex
The checker evidence now has meaningful S2/S3 rules, including a negative test that the canonical source without evidence emits nine insufficiency diagnostics. The risk is still scope: execute/review/override rows have lighter or later checks, and component metadata still exposes enough route surfaces that a final pass must prove dead-delete/quarantine rather than just record evidence objects.
